# The coverage profile the gate measures. CI writes it on every run and
# reads it once; it never belongs to the tree.
/coverage.out

# The coverage report that `make coverage-report` draws for the site.
/coverage.html

# The binary that `go build` writes here.
/observatory-operator

# Hugo's build output. The workflow and a workstation both write the
# site here, and the lock file guards a single hugo process against a
# second one in the same source tree.
/docs/dist/
/docs/.hugo_build.lock
/docs/public/
